rosses null; H167 outcome_005 +0.0119 vs threshold about 0.0250; H168 outcome_008 +0.0136 vs threshold about 0.0282; H169 outcome_013 -0.0046; H173 outcome_012 -0.0205 opposite the registered direction; H175 outcome_011 +0.0059; H183 outcome_014 -0.0066. I reject all of these for the original claims and close them. Overall, feature_021 remains a very broad and robust measured association for outcome_006 in this dataset, whereas feature_020 is best interpreted as a narrower outcome_006-specific marginal association that arose from a marker screen. This does not establish causality, leakage, mechanism, or external generalizability. No validation can be requested because the validation budget is exhausted.",
