ing unresolved candidates are mostly imprecise or multiplicity-sensitive, including H268 outcome_006 feature_007, H128 outcome_006 feature_023, and the rare feature_028 level_003 versus level_002 candidates. All conclusions are observational associations in this supplied dataset using opaque predictor labels; they do not establish causality, mechanism, leakage-free biology, or external generalizability. The most informative next analysis is strict pre-specified external validation of H107 as primary, H111 and cautiously H254 as secondary, plus the planned H273 robustness test for feature_007 within feature_021 present, without additional post-hoc subgroup mining.",
